  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tanzania Agriculture Climate Adaptation Technology Deployment Programme (TACATDP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TACATDP is a lending facility that aims to strengthen agriculture resilience and adaptation (ARA) through affordable credit and innovative de-risking financial instruments. 

&#x2022; The programme addresses adaptation needs in the agriculture sector which is a key contributor to the economy and highly vulnerable to climate change risks.
&#x2022; It focuses on the Tanzanian agriculture crop sector to promote the adoption of adaptation technologies to address climate risks and increase crop yields resiliently. 
&#x2022; By establishing the large-scale lending facility and deploying de-risking instruments, the programme will help de-risk credit for smallholder farmers and agriculture MSMEs and unlock private investments for scaling up ARA lending in the country.</narrative>
  </description>
